==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|HeartGold & SoulSilver|Magikarp|72}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|HeartGold & SoulSilver}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dragon Majesty|Magikarp|19}} from the {{TCG|Dragon Majesty}} expansion.
*{{m|Splash}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Magikarp}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

